delivery, minimal temperature setback, attention to radiant temperature as well as air temperature, and moisture management appropriate for vapor-open masonry construction all contribute to comfort that respects your home&#039;s historic character. Let&#039;s assess your home&#039;s specific thermal needs and find the system that fits both your building physics and your lifestyle.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Schedule the Masonry Building Review<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: &quot;1501-1509 R Street NW&quot; by NCinDC, BY-ND, via Openverse \u00b7 &quot;Cast Iron Radiator Refurbishment&quot; by gavindjharper, BY-ND, via Openverse \u00b7 &quot;Night Street&quot; by *rboed*, BY, via Openverse<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lititz HVAC solutions for Moravian-era stone and brick homes. Historic masonry heating expertise addressing thermal mass and preservation.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":1484,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"location","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_angie_page":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-155","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Your Lititz Stone Walls Store Heat \u2014 and Fight Your Thermostat - Keystone Comfort Co.<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lititz HVAC solutions for Moravian-era stone and brick homes. Historic masonry heating expertise addressing thermal mass and preservation.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" conten